# Store captures and framed outputs are regenerated (see marketing/store-assets/README.md)
marketing/store-assets/raw/
marketing/store-assets/android/
marketing/store-assets/ios/

# Raw gameplay footage is large; its sha256 is in marketing-captures/*/capture-log.json
marketing-captures/**/*.mp4
